keybinds/
Status: Working

Esc → close
Tab → cycle drawers
Arrow up/down → navigate drawers
Arrow left/right → navigate app grid (highlights focused app)
Enter → launch focused app (via KeyReleased on keyboard::listen())
S → focus search bar
V → open vault
Ctrl+1-9 → jump to drawer by index

